            <title>[MAHOUT-856] build-20news-bayes.sh doesn&apos;t work when downloading content</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-856</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The build-20news-bayes.sh script doesn&apos;t work when downloading the content for the first time.  The issue is that it changes the directory to the temp directory and then later tries to do &quot;cd ../..&quot; to get back to MAHOUT_HOME, but that doesn&apos;t work if it changes to the /tmp directory.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
